The following outline is provided as an overview of and topical guide to [[game]]s:

A game is a [[structure]]d type of [[play (activity)|play]] usually undertaken for [[entertainment]] or [[fun]]. Games can also be [[Work (human activity)|work]], [[art]] or an [[Education|educational tool]].<ref name="merriam-webster.com">{{Cite web |title=Definition of GAME |url=https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/game |access-date=7 May 2017 |website=Merriam-Webster }}</ref>

