== Purpose ==
Individuals participate in game-play for various reasons, depending upon the aspect the particular game covers. These include:

*[[Education]] &ndash; The transmission of knowledge, skills and character traits.
**[[Learning analytics]] &ndash; Collecting data about learners for understanding and optimizing learning.
*[[Entertainment]] &ndash; Activity that holds attention or gives pleasure.
**[[Play (activity)|Play]] &ndash; Intrinsically motivated recreation.
**[[Social relation]] &ndash; Interpersonal relationship between two or more people.
*[[Pleasure]] &ndash; Experience that feels good, is enjoyable.
**[[Hobby]] &ndash; A regular pleasurable activity.
*[[Strategy]] &ndash; Plan to achieve goals in uncertainty.
**[[Tactic (method)|Tactics]] &ndash; Conceptual action or short series of actions with the aim of achieving a short-term goal.

